    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d529">

                <pb facs="0588" n="472" xml:id="pg472"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/1178.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Sullivan to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 18, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your May 17. Dominican Government assures me vigorous action has been ordered to
                    prevent deliveries of ammunition to Haitian revolutionists. Similar assurance
                    given to Haitian Minister. General receiver of customs under the command of
                    Dominican Government has ordered revenue cutter to Monte Christi.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sullivan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
